<title>SWITZERLAND: Pictet upgrades Zurich to accumulate.</title>
<headline>Pictet upgrades Zurich to accumulate.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pictet &amp; Cie said it had upgraded its earnings estimates for Zurich Group and raised its recommendation for shares to accumulate.</p>
<p>It gave these new estimates:</p>
<p> (million Sfr)				  1997     1998     1999</p>
<p> Gross premiums			  34,000   36,000   38,000</p>
<p> Non-life underwiting result	 -1,983   -2,173   -2,475</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit			   2,184    2,608    3,143</p>
<p>   Non-life				 1,727    2,005    2,403</p>
<p>   Life					 457	603	740</p>
<p> Attributable net profit		1,400    1,690    2,070</p>
<p> EPS (Sfr)				   29.8     36.0     44.1</p>
<p> P/E (x)				     17.4     14.4     11.8</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
